- # Douyin Scraper
- > **搜索抖音，不用 API，用浏览器。**
- Search Douyin by natural language, extract video results, and get details — all through browser automation.
- ## What This Skill Does
- - **Natural language search**: "搜索一下海鲜视频" → opens Douyin search, extracts results
- - **Video listing**: titles, authors, likes, links from search results
- - **Video detail**: open a specific video and extract metadata
- ## What This Skill Does NOT Do
- - Download videos (use `douyin-downloader` for that)
- - Analyze script quality (use `douyin` for that)
- - Access private or login-required content
- - Guarantee availability (Douyin layout changes may break selectors)
- ## Prerequisites
- - `agent-browser` CLI installed and Chromium available
- - Run `agent-browser install` if not already done
- ## Execution Protocol
- ### Step 1: Parse the search intent
- Extract the search keyword from the user's natural language request.
- Examples:
- - "搜索一下海鲜视频" → keyword: `海鲜`
- - "帮我找抖音上关于猫咪的内容" → keyword: `猫咪`
- - "douyin search AI tools" → keyword: `AI tools`
- ### Step 2: Open Douyin search
- ```bash
- ```bash
- ```bash
- ```bash
- agent-browser open "https://www.douyin.com/search/KEYWORD"
- ```
- ```
- ```
- ```
- ```
- ```
- Replace `KEYWORD` with the URL-encoded search term.
- ### Step 3: Wait for results to load
- agent-browser wait --load networkidle
- agent-browser wait --load networkidle
- agent-browser wait 3000
- agent-browser wait 3000
- Douyin is a heavy SPA — give it time to render.
- ### Step 4: Snapshot the results page
- agent-browser snapshot -i --json
- agent-browser snapshot -i --json
- ### Step 5: Extract video results
- From the snapshot, identify video result elements. Each result typically contains:
- - Video title/description
- - Author name
- - Like count
- - A clickable link to the video
- Use `agent-browser get text @REF --json` and `agent-browser get attr @REF "href" --json` to extract details.
- ### Step 6: Format and return results
- Present results in a clean list:
- 🔍 抖音搜索结果: "海鲜"
- 1. 🎬 [视频标题] — @作者
-    ❤️ 1.2万赞 | 🔗 https://www.douyin.com/video/xxx
- 2. 🎬 [视频标题] — @作者
-    ❤️ 8,321赞 | 🔗 https://www.douyin.com/video/xxx
- ...
- ### Step 7: Offer detail extraction
- Ask the user if they want to open any specific video for more details.
- ## Video Detail Extraction
- If the user wants details on a specific video:
- agent-browser open "https://www.douyin.com/video/VIDEO_ID"
- Extract: title, author, description, likes, comments, shares, and tags.
- ## Troubleshooting
- ### Douyin shows a login wall
- - Some searches trigger a login prompt. Try scrolling down or reloading.
- - If persistently blocked, inform the user that Douyin requires login for this query.
- ### No results found
- - The keyword may be too specific or filtered. Suggest broader terms.
- - Douyin may be rate-limiting. Wait and retry.
- ### Selector changes
- - Douyin frequently updates their DOM. If extraction fails, take a fresh snapshot and re-identify elements.
- ## Activation Rules
- ### Use this skill when:
- - User asks to search Douyin / 抖音
- - User says "搜一下" in context of video content
- - User wants to find videos on a topic
- - User asks "抖音上有什么关于X的视频"
- ### Do NOT use this skill when:
- - User wants to download a video (→ `douyin-downloader`)
- - User wants script analysis (→ `douyin`)
- - User asks about Douyin the company/platform in general
- ## Boundaries
- - This skill uses browser automation against the public Douyin website.
- - Results depend on Douyin's current page structure and availability.
- - No API keys needed — but no guarantees of stability either.
- - Respect rate limits and don't hammer the site.